.TH MATRIXCODE 6 "September 2026" "Matrix Code" "XScreenSaver manual"
.SH NAME
matrixcode \- render film-accurate Matrix digital rain
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B MatrixCode
[
.I mode
]
[
.I options
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B MatrixCode
is a native Qt and OpenGL implementation of Matrix digital rain. XScreenSaver
launches it through the
.B matrixcode
helper, while the standalone application provides the complete settings editor.
.SH MODES
.TP 8
.B \-\-settings
Open the complete Matrix Code settings editor without starting playback.
.TP 8
.B \-\-screensaver
Run full-screen screen-saver playback.
.TP 8
.BR \-root ", " \-\-root
Run XScreenSaver root-window playback. If
.B XSCREENSAVER_WINDOW
is set, render inside that host window.
.TP 8
.BI \-\-window\-id " window"
Render inside an X11 preview window. The conventional
.BI \-window\-id " window"
form is also accepted.
.TP 8
.B \-\-multi\-monitor
Present one continuous virtual grid across every display.
.TP 8
.BI \-\-capture " path"
Write a deterministic renderer capture to the specified path.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP 8
.B \-\-software
Force the software OpenGL implementation.
.TP 8
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print command-line help.
.SH FILES
.TP 8
.I ~/.config/MatrixCode/settings.json
Versioned Matrix Code settings shared by standalone and screen-saver playback.
.TP 8
.I ~/.xscreensaver
XScreenSaver program registration and selected launcher options.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP 8
.B DISPLAY
The X11 display used for XScreenSaver playback and preview embedding.
.TP 8
.B XSCREENSAVER_WINDOW
The X11 host window used with
.BR \-root " or " \-\-root .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xscreensaver (1),
.BR xscreensaver-settings (1)
